{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Calibri;}}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\qc\b\fs36 Urban Mynah Product Catalog\b0\fs22\par\ql\par\b\fs28 1. Wall hangings\b0\fs22\par\par\b Triangle Tassel Wall Hanging\b0\par A handmade triangle wall hanging with earthy beads and playful tassels\u8212?an easy touch of natural style.\par Length: 40 cm; Width: 30 cm\par Materials: Cardboard rolls, jute rope, jute macrame, cotton embroidery thread, clear quartz crystals, green beads, mini wooden logs, tiger eye crystal, mini square canvas, marble beads, white acrylic paint.\par\par\b House-Frame Green Stone Wall Hanging\b0\par A handmade wall hanging with a woven center and green stone.\par Length: 25 cm; Width: 17 cm\par Materials: Cardboard rolls, jute rope, jute macrame, cotton embroidery thread, clear quartz crystals, green beads, citrine crystal, marble beads, white acrylic paint.\par\par\b Three-Feather Branch Wall Hanging\b0\par A handmade branch hanging with three feathers and natural beads.\par Length: 30 cm; Width: 30 cm\par Materials: Cardboard rolls, jute rope, jute macrame, cotton embroidery thread, clear quartz crystals, green beads, circular brown beads, marble beads, white acrylic paint.\par\par\b Moon-framed wall hanging\b0\par A moon-shaped frame with a woven center and green beads.\par Length: 20 cm; Width: 10 cm\par Materials: Wooden twigs, jute rope, jute macrame, cotton embroidery thread, clear quartz crystals, transparent pebbles, green beads, white acrylic paint.\par\par\b Giant leaf shaped wall hanging\b0\par A woven web with jute feathers and natural branches.\par Length: 80 cm; Width: 50 cm\par Materials: Wooden twigs, jute rope, jute macrame, cotton embroidery thread, clear quartz crystals, transparent pebbles, green beads, bugle beads, mini wooden logs, circular brown beads, white acrylic paint.\par\par\b Wooden twigs circular wall hanging\b0\par A handcrafted twig wreath with a tiny open book, delicate flowers, butterfly charms and purple crystal drops.\par Materials: Wooden twigs wreath, metal butterflies, dried flowers, purple craft flowers, pearl, bronze chain, glass Christmas balls, purple glitter, handmade vintage book.\par\par\b\fs28 2. Mini canvas paintings\b0\fs22\par\par\b Naruto and Kurama\b0\par A bold mini canvas featuring a striking split-face design with fiery orange tones and intense eyes.\par Materials: Mini canvas, canvas stand, acrylic paint, varnish.\par\par\b Itachi eyes\b0\par Inspired by the Itachi Uchiha's style, highlighted through detailed strokes and bold contrasts.\par Materials: Mini canvas, canvas stand, acrylic paint, varnish.\par\par\b Saiyan Spirit\b0\par A striking anime portrait brought to life with fiery orange shades and electric blue details.\par Materials: Mini canvas, canvas stand, acrylic paint, varnish.\par\par\b The Copy Ninja\b0\par Featuring Kakashi's signature masked look and iconic eye.\par Materials: Mini canvas, canvas stand, acrylic paint, varnish.\par\par\b Precious Bonds\b0\par Inspired by I Want to Eat Your Pancreas, this painting captures the beauty of human connections and the memories we create with others.\par Materials: Mini canvas, canvas stand, acrylic paint, varnish.\par\par\b\fs28 3. Accessories\b0\fs22\par\par\b Purple Pearl Bangles\b0\par Purple silk-thread bangles with pearl accents and floral stone work.\par Materials: Lavender silk thread, pink silk thread, yellow silk thread, mirror, pearl, kundan.\par\par\b Green Flower Bangles\b0\par Green silk-thread bangles with floral stones and contrasting thread details.\par Materials: Green silk thread, beige silk thread, bangle base in-built with flowers.\par\par\b Red and Peach Bangles\b0\par Red and peach silk-thread bangles with sparkling floral stone work.\par Materials: Peach silk thread, red silk thread, bangles base in-built with flowers.\par\par\b Pink chuda\b0\par A handcrafted bridal chuda featuring vibrant silk threads, intricate mirror work, delicate stones and golden embellishments.\par Materials: Hot pink silk thread, golden yellow silk thread, blush pink silk thread, kundan, nag, beads, mirror work.\par\par\b\fs28 4. Bookmarks\b0\fs22\par\par\b Gojo with Quotes\b0\par A hand-painted portrait of Gojo Satoru with memorable quotes.\par Materials: 360 gsm paper, Fevicryl paint, spray varnish.\par\par\b Gojo with Glasses\b0\par A colourful portrait of Gojo Satoru in his signature blue shades. Playful, vibrant and full of character.\par Materials: 360 gsm paper, Fevicryl paint, spray varnish.\par\par\b Gojo Portrait\b0\par A hand-painted illustration of Gojo Satoru with soft colours and detailed artwork.\par Materials: 360 gsm paper, Fevicryl paint, spray varnish.\par\par\b Gojo in Black\b0\par Featuring Gojo Satoru in his classic black outfit with the words "Infinity Exists Everywhere."\par Materials: 360 gsm paper, Fevicryl paint, spray varnish.\par\par\b Giyu Tomioka \u8211? Water Hashira\b0\par Inspired by Giyu Tomioka from Demon Slayer, this hand-painted bookmark captures his calm charm and iconic look.\par Materials: 360 gsm paper, Fevicryl paint, spray varnish.\par\par\b Minato Namikaze (The Yellow Flash)\b0\par Inspired by Minato Namikaze from Naruto, this bookmark captures his iconic look and fearless spirit.\par Materials: 360 gsm paper, Fevicryl paint, spray varnish.\par\par\b\fs28 5. Miscellaneous\b0\fs22\par\par\b DIY Doll\b0\par A handmade fabric doll featuring soft yarn hair, red bows, rosy cheeks and a red frock with a rose.\par Materials: Muslin, jute thread, red embroidery thread, red organza fabric, soft cotton, shredded fabric, soft pastel colour, miniature rose.\par\par\b Yellow muffler\b0\par Handmade with soft, fluffy yarn, this yellow muffler is designed to keep you warm and cosy.\par Materials: Squishy thick yellow wool yarn.\par}